flowchart LR
    T[Triage] -->|human decides,<br/>brief written| B[Backlog]
    B -->|assigned to the swarm,<br/>draft PR opened| AC[Active<br/><i>issue card</i>]
    AC -.->|PR card starts here| IP[In Progress<br/><i>PR is a draft</i>]
    IP -->|question for a human| NI[Needs Input]
    NI -->|human moves the card| IP
    IP -->|coordinator pre-check passes<br/>PR marked ready| AR[Auto Review<br/><i>automated reviewer runs</i>]
    AR -->|P1 or P2 finding<br/>PR back to draft| IP
    AR -->|waits for a slot<br/>or another PR| P[Pending<br/><i>queue</i>]
    P -->|slot opens,<br/>gate passes| HR
    AR -->|clean + post-check +<br/>Linux checks green +<br/>screenshots in PR| HR[Human Review<br/><i>two slots</i>]
    HR -->|human moves the card<br/>or late finding| IP
    HR -->|human merges to main| D[Done]
